        <mxCell id="-DPXh-h7QqhF4jSscgDO-53" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Small hydro power plant (2 x 4.5 MVA)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Two 4.5 MVA salient-pole generators (X&quot;d = 0.16 pu, R&quot;G = 0.07 X&quot;d) on a 6.3 kV busbar,&lt;br&gt;a 10 MVA YNd5 step-up transformer and a 9 km 20 kV overhead line with a village tee&lt;br&gt;to the utility substation (S&quot;k max/min 250/180 MVA). Station service via 400 kVA.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Try:&lt;/b&gt; Load Flow – export of 7.6 MW, voltage rise along the line, generator reactive power;&lt;br&gt;Short Circuit IEC 60909 – generator contribution (with K_G correction) at the 6.3 kV and&lt;br&gt;20 kV buses, minimum fault level at the plant for protection settings." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#81c784;" vertex="1" parent="-DPXh-h7QqhF4jSscgDO-1">
